WEBVTT

02:06.430 --> 02:07.380
Sheza, hurry.

02:07.830 --> 02:09.510
I'll take care of this place.

02:11.180 --> 02:12.870
Watch out! Run!

02:24.040 --> 02:25.820
Still resisting?

02:29.840 --> 02:30.840
Munto...

02:36.560 --> 02:37.370
Yumemi...

02:41.320 --> 02:42.170
Yumemi!

02:42.720 --> 02:43.730
Munto,

02:44.620 --> 02:46.930
I won't give up.

02:59.730 --> 03:01.310
Hey, what's going on?

03:01.600 --> 03:03.360
Lady Ryuely, this is...

03:12.730 --> 03:14.530
What are you laughing at?!

03:26.650 --> 03:27.630
No one...

03:28.890 --> 03:31.380
...can take away this wave.

03:32.530 --> 03:33.910
Cut the crap!

03:33.910 --> 03:35.510
Regardless of who that girl is-

03:39.100 --> 03:40.890
It's over, Gridori.

03:40.890 --> 03:42.900
Outsider!

03:43.210 --> 03:44.190
Gass!

03:44.880 --> 03:47.150
You bastard! How did you...?

03:47.770 --> 03:49.330
How ridiculous.

03:50.080 --> 03:56.160
I can't believe someone would save me, a person who has severed all relations.

03:57.180 --> 04:02.710
You involved yourself with people and lost your status as an Outsider, huh?!

04:02.710 --> 04:04.040
You fool!

04:06.370 --> 04:08.710
You'll never understand.

04:10.080 --> 04:10.960
Munto.

04:12.070 --> 04:14.090
I'm taking him away.

04:14.800 --> 04:15.970
Gass, what are you going to do?!

04:16.470 --> 04:18.970
Don't let the Heavens fall, Munto.

04:19.480 --> 04:21.980
Don't ever let go of those hands.

04:27.400 --> 04:28.300
Gass!

04:29.150 --> 04:33.270
I'm certain I saw your dream.

04:34.840 --> 04:35.570
Farewell.

06:01.950 --> 06:05.920
This is what happens when the flow of Akuto stops, despite its abundance.

06:06.460 --> 06:07.850
There's no way to...

06:53.070 --> 06:54.040
Munto?

07:21.030 --> 07:22.450
Let's go, Yumemi.

07:44.500 --> 07:47.350
Hey, what did you mean by "preparations to open the future"?

07:51.830 --> 07:54.250
Oh, was I not supposed to ask?

07:54.250 --> 07:55.670
I need to show you a mirror.

07:56.950 --> 07:57.960
A mirror?

07:58.780 --> 08:01.030
Um, that's it?

08:12.020 --> 08:15.170
She's the royal prophetess, Ryuely.

08:15.170 --> 08:16.880
She'll help you get prepared.

08:20.550 --> 08:24.300
I'm honestly glad that you came.

08:25.330 --> 08:26.480
Okay...

08:26.480 --> 08:27.140
Um...

08:27.440 --> 08:30.040
Nice to meet you.

08:30.040 --> 08:31.420
My name is Hidaka Yumemi-

08:35.980 --> 08:37.020
Oh, I forgot.

08:37.890 --> 08:38.800
Toche.

08:39.300 --> 08:40.950
Yes, Lady Ryuely?

08:41.480 --> 08:43.280
Please take Miss Yumemi to that place.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.530
Yes!

09:06.410 --> 09:07.720
So...

09:08.090 --> 09:09.890
Are these fruits?

09:10.250 --> 09:14.860
Yes, they're fruits of the Heavens created just for you.

09:22.150 --> 09:25.370
Don't worry, they're edible!

09:38.490 --> 09:40.880
It tastes weird, but it's good.

09:48.170 --> 09:50.510
You people don't eat?

09:51.260 --> 09:57.110
Yeah, we don't take in things that have a definite shape.

09:59.500 --> 10:06.950
Heavenly Beings only take in Akuto, the almighty power and the source of all life.

10:09.160 --> 10:11.700
You can eat Akuto?

10:12.090 --> 10:17.210
You can say that, but it's more like absorbing it after your body resonates with it.

10:22.240 --> 10:27.760
In order to raise the efficiency of absorbing Akuto,

10:28.190 --> 10:32.010
the Heavenly Beings long ago replaced their bodies with Akuto-created material.

10:33.770 --> 10:35.130
So...

10:35.750 --> 10:41.240
Akuto is some kind of invisible energy?

10:41.240 --> 10:44.020
You mean your bodies are created by that?

10:44.350 --> 10:49.280
Yes, everything in the Heavens is made out of Akuto.

10:49.590 --> 10:52.810
Whether it's those fruits from earlier or our bodies,

10:52.820 --> 10:58.960
we release small amounts of Akuto
which circulate the Heavens entirely.

10:58.960 --> 11:01.500
That's how everyone supports each other.

11:02.020 --> 11:04.830
I don't really understand, but okay.

11:05.360 --> 11:09.670
And then, there's the one who creates Akuto out of nothing.

11:09.670 --> 11:12.900
That's you, Miss Yumemi.

11:13.840 --> 11:15.080
Please take a look.

11:15.810 --> 11:17.820
This is the world birthed by Akuto.

11:26.250 --> 11:30.060
The almighty Akuto, which is fundamental to the Heavens,

11:30.060 --> 11:32.660
nearly dried out around a year ago.

11:33.110 --> 11:38.660
When what's left of the Akuto runs
out, this world will meet its destruction.

11:39.280 --> 11:45.880
The people who released us from that crisis were Lord Munto and you, Miss Yumemi.

11:46.680 --> 11:52.510
We were saved by the Akuto that was sent over from your world.

11:53.380 --> 11:57.140
However, the true crisis still hasn't been resolved.

11:57.480 --> 12:02.140
Lord Munto said, "The journey to opening up our futures starts here."

12:05.190 --> 12:11.150
When that time comes, I will stand courageously and fight alongside everyone else...

12:11.910 --> 12:15.160
...in order to open up our future.

12:18.720 --> 12:22.370
I have no confidence and I'm powerless,

12:22.870 --> 12:27.490
but even so, I want to protect my family and friends.

12:27.490 --> 12:31.090
I'd also like to see the future you're going to open up.

12:33.660 --> 12:36.590
That's why I will try my best,

12:37.710 --> 12:39.100
along with everyone else.

12:41.470 --> 12:43.130
He says he'll fight too.

12:45.440 --> 12:47.950
I'll be counting on you when the time comes, okay?

12:57.680 --> 12:59.540
I saw it.

13:00.490 --> 13:04.250
That girl is amazingly powerful.

13:04.600 --> 13:08.000
She passed through the continuum with just her body alone.

13:08.800 --> 13:12.510
I can't believe it was a human who did that.

13:13.010 --> 13:18.510
Perhaps this girl might really bring a future to the Heavens...

13:20.940 --> 13:23.220
So your conclusions are...

13:23.630 --> 13:28.400
The Heavenly Beings' wisdom was already engulfed by the tidal wave of Akuto.

13:29.220 --> 13:34.210
Gntarl, we should not attack the Magical Kingdom anymore.

13:34.210 --> 13:39.450
We just need to watch over their king - Munto's actions.

13:40.060 --> 13:41.990
How foolish.

13:42.370 --> 13:50.880
What we should do right now is bring that fragile girl to our side and crystallize her, thereby stabilizing her power.

13:51.110 --> 13:54.880
Then we can use her powers to save the Heavens from meeting its destruction.

13:55.200 --> 13:58.370
Gntarl, we cannot interfere-

13:58.370 --> 14:00.020
Don't joke around!

14:00.020 --> 14:02.680
There will be no future for those who don't take action!

14:07.430 --> 14:10.480
We chose the wrong road, once...

14:10.490 --> 14:13.480
From now on, you're not allowed to act under the Union-

14:15.030 --> 14:18.670
If I am going to just sit here awaiting death,

14:18.670 --> 14:21.430
I would rather ignore the orders of the Union.

14:33.560 --> 14:39.090
How can I leave the future of the Heavens in Munto's hands?

14:53.710 --> 14:56.250
The bond between the worlds is fluctuating.

14:56.250 --> 15:01.490
We have to turn that bond into an entity and connect both worlds.

15:02.150 --> 15:04.900
Before we make that preparation with Ryuely,

15:04.900 --> 15:07.580
I want to show you something first.

15:12.580 --> 15:16.670
Take a look at all the mistakes the
Heavens made a long, long time ago.

15:18.170 --> 15:19.260
These...

15:19.270 --> 15:21.050
...are the memories of my lonely heart.

15:28.790 --> 15:32.430
What you are now looking at is the distant past of this planet.

15:33.350 --> 15:36.270
This was back then when the Heavens - the Ancient World - didn't exist.

15:37.340 --> 15:40.190
Some unknown beings fell out of nowhere onto this island...

15:40.870 --> 15:44.070
...which already had thousands of years of civilization.

15:45.190 --> 15:50.620
They were beings that controlled the almighty Akuto, the wave of human thought.

15:51.680 --> 15:52.460
Akuto?

15:53.060 --> 15:57.380
The human spirit is composed of feelings, wishes, and dreams.

15:58.590 --> 16:03.760
Those beings could freely transform the waves of
human spirit, Akuto, into power or physical objects.

16:04.600 --> 16:09.370
It was truly an almighty power that rivaled the power of God.

16:10.880 --> 16:14.780
However, those beings failed to truly obtain the Akuto.

16:16.880 --> 16:22.040
Indulged by that power, they lost their minds and emotions.

16:24.530 --> 16:27.070
They recklessly used the power of this planet,

16:27.660 --> 16:31.120
and killed off the Akuto breeders at a fierce rate.

16:31.130 --> 16:32.900
Those breeders were known as humans.

16:36.230 --> 16:41.140
A civilization that existed for thousands of years was wiped from the face of the Earth within a few days.

16:42.680 --> 16:44.810
However, they didn't stop their foolish actions.

16:45.600 --> 16:48.210
In order to pass through the walls which split up time,

16:48.210 --> 16:50.360
they forced change on the planet's structure.

16:51.700 --> 16:53.000
The planet's structure?

16:54.530 --> 16:59.660
The lost Akuto circulated in from other space and time.

17:00.380 --> 17:04.160
Realizing that, they planned to cross over into those other space-times.

17:04.160 --> 17:08.320
But in order to do so, they interfered with the waves of the other planets and distorted their original forms.

17:08.320 --> 17:12.160
Using the power created from
that, they ripped space and time.

17:13.750 --> 17:17.540
They then invaded and raided the different space-times.

17:19.330 --> 17:24.340
Each planet's feelings, wishes, and dreams dried up like the twinkling of a star.

17:25.600 --> 17:30.870
All planets, space-times, and spirits sunk to the bottom of darkness.

17:32.810 --> 17:35.720
Then, after those long, outrageous days,

17:35.730 --> 17:41.150
they used the unlimited Akuto stolen from the other space-times to create a new world inside this sky -

17:43.660 --> 17:45.590
a world known as the Heavens.

17:46.610 --> 17:50.170
A world that was populated by an almighty people who ruled over all space and time.

17:51.830 --> 17:55.120
Those people called themselves Heavenly Beings,

17:55.120 --> 17:58.370
and named the source of their power, the waves of the spirit, Akuto.

18:00.040 --> 18:03.670
Correct. The world we're in right now...

18:03.670 --> 18:08.890
...was created through the ugliness of pillaging spirits and destruction of other planets.

18:10.630 --> 18:18.890
In their thrones of the polluted sky, the omnipotent rulers exhausted the limits of enjoyment and indulged in pleasure.

18:19.390 --> 18:22.560
It wasn't long before they grew weary of it all.

18:24.320 --> 18:27.140
Karma could easily foretell the fate of such a world.

18:27.880 --> 18:33.160
The Heavens fell into ruin and into a state of total decay.

18:33.610 --> 18:36.360
It became a world that was basically awaiting its own death.

18:38.910 --> 18:42.670
On the other side, the people who were waiting for this chance appeared.

18:44.060 --> 18:48.840
They were the surface dwellers whose goal was to regain the future that was stolen from them...

18:49.050 --> 18:51.530
...after long having their spirits corroded.

18:52.320 --> 18:55.600
They were humans who were abandoned because they were...

18:55.770 --> 18:58.890
..."failures" of the life-forms that were created to supply Akuto.

18:59.940 --> 19:03.810
Even though they were abandoned to the Lower World, they never gave up their hope for living.

19:04.560 --> 19:06.170
After a long time of enduring hardships,

19:06.170 --> 19:08.950
they used this long-awaited chance to launch an attack on the Heavens.

19:10.100 --> 19:13.370
Their strength overwhelmed the Heavenly Beings.

19:14.540 --> 19:16.740
The king of the Heavens was forced to choose between...

19:17.640 --> 19:24.130
...dying in battle or severing the bonds that supplied Akuto to the world.

19:28.550 --> 19:30.400
They sealed off space and time.

19:32.710 --> 19:34.830
All the pillars fell to the Lower World...

19:35.520 --> 19:39.430
...and burned the world of the surface dwellers who polluted the Heavens.

19:40.460 --> 19:44.680
All bonds were cut and all communication ceased with the Lower World.

19:46.970 --> 19:49.270
This is what is known as the "Calamitous Day".

19:52.030 --> 19:56.580
After that, the Heavenly Beings considered all interference with space and time to be taboo,

19:56.600 --> 19:58.910
and they appointed a guardian at the door of time.

19:59.900 --> 20:05.250
These cursed guardians were given a power greater than that of the kings,

20:05.250 --> 20:07.430
after they severed their relationships with everything else.

20:08.870 --> 20:14.460
These magical deities who never interact with the outside world were called Outsiders.

20:14.460 --> 20:16.680
They were shunned by all generations.

20:18.970 --> 20:24.850
Ironically, the guardians, the gate that the
Heavenly Beings created to protect themselves...

20:25.150 --> 20:28.230
...became the very obstacle to saving the Heavens later on.

20:29.410 --> 20:31.800
There is only one road left for the Heavens -

20:32.280 --> 20:36.950
that of calling back the Akuto that once circulated this sky.

20:41.200 --> 20:44.240
The only obstacle on this road was the Outsider himself.

20:45.230 --> 20:50.630
Gass, after realizing this, went against his fate and left the Heavens.

20:55.170 --> 20:58.850
The bond of the light is connected by the power he left behind.

20:59.530 --> 21:04.650
We shall return in order to connect your world and my world.

21:05.660 --> 21:08.860
If it succeeds, both worlds will...

21:09.270 --> 21:12.110
...be able to restore the cycle of the spirits.

21:19.050 --> 21:22.860
Although the Heavens is a sin-ridden world, I don't want it to fall.

21:31.500 --> 21:34.330
Munto, is...

21:34.880 --> 21:40.600
...restoring the cycle of Akuto, the spirits, really the right thing to do?

21:41.550 --> 21:45.050
The mistakes of the past cannot be changed.

21:45.850 --> 21:52.210
However, we can create a new future to make up for the sins of the past.

22:11.760 --> 22:13.170
There isn't much time left.

22:14.080 --> 22:16.670
I'll go first to buy us some time.

22:18.510 --> 22:22.510
Come back after you've prepared yourself with Ryuely.

22:22.810 --> 22:23.650
But...

22:24.470 --> 22:25.390
Yumemi.

22:28.370 --> 22:30.900
I can't open up the future by myself.

22:32.020 --> 22:33.790
I need your strength.

22:39.720 --> 22:41.000
I'll be waiting for you.

24:32.070 --> 24:35.510
There are no toilets in the Heavens; what should I do, Ichiko?!

24:35.510 --> 24:37.430
I'm also troubled by what to do.

24:37.430 --> 24:38.520
What should I do?!

24:38.520 --> 24:41.200
So, Ichiko, Suzume, don't drink too much water!

24:41.200 --> 24:43.150
You should've told me that earlier!

24:43.960 --> 24:44.980
Next episode of...

24:44.980 --> 24:47.410
...The World Reflected in the Eyes of a Girl who Looks Up at the Sky:

24:47.410 --> 24:48.770
Not Giving Up.
